{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RWvTSaoYBXZVvSUKEAZ2jf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Tesseract OCR Image Processor\n2\t\n3\t## Goal\n4\tProvide a Bash script that runs Tesseract OCR over images in an input directory and produces output files (text + hOCR/PDF overlay) in a separate output directory, preserving word-position data for highlight-capable viewing.\n5\t\n6\t## Scope\n7\t- **In scope:** Batch processing of common image formats (PNG, JPG, TIFF), output of `.txt` and `.hocr` (or searchable PDF) per image, output to a configurable destination folder\n8\t- **In scope:** hOCR output enables word highlighting in compatible viewers (e.g., browser-rendered hOCR or PDF with text layer)\n9\t- **Out of scope:** Building a custom viewer — the hOCR/PDF output relies on existing tools (browser, `evince`, `okular`)\n10\t- **Out of scope:** Training custom Tesseract models\n11\t\n12\t## Getting Started\n13\tTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4a9a0c21-250b-47df-bfb8-035bd6b27178","uuid":"a4defce5-fc99-4f20-960a-2b43764b2061","timestamp":"2026-04-23T04:16:43.024Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/sysoper/workspace/WhileISleep/batch-output/tesseract-ocr-image-processor/README.md","content":"# Tesseract OCR Image Processor\n\n## Goal\nProvide a Bash script that runs Tesseract OCR over images in an input directory and produces output files (text + hOCR/PDF overlay) in a separate output directory, preserving word-position data for highlight-capable viewing.\n\n## Scope\n- **In scope:** Batch processing of common image formats (PNG, JPG, TIFF), output of `.txt` and `.hocr` (or searchable PDF) per image, output to a configurable destination folder\n- **In scope:** hOCR output enables word highlighting in compatible viewers (e.g., browser-rendered hOCR or PDF with text layer)\n- **Out of scope:** Building a custom viewer — the hOCR/PDF output relies on existing tools (browser, `evince`, `okular`)\n- **Out of scope:** Training custom Tesseract models\n\n## Getting Started\nTBD — fill in once prototype is scaffolded.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}}}
